@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> AdjustTime
AdjustTime --> IncreaseValue : increase value while adjusting time settings
AdjustTime --> DecreaseValue : decrease value while adjusting time settings
DecreaseValue --> AlarmFeature
AlarmFeature --> TurnOnAlarm : turn on alarm feature
TurnOnAlarm --> SetAlarmTime : set alarm time
SetAlarmTime --> TriggerAlarm : trigger alarm when current time matches set alarm time
TriggerAlarm --> StopAlarm : stop alarm by pressing specific button
StopAlarm --> LightFeature
LightFeature --> TurnOnLight : turn on light feature
TurnOnLight --> TurnOffLight : turn off light feature

Idle --> SwitchMode : switch between changing hour, minutes, alarm hour, and alarm minutes
SwitchMode --> AlarmHourMode : switch to alarm hour mode
AlarmHourMode --> AlarmMinuteMode : switch to alarm minute mode
AlarmMinuteMode --> TimeMode : switch to time mode
TimeMode --> Idle : return to idle state

Idle --> TurnOnAlarmFeature : turn on alarm feature
TurnOnAlarmFeature --> SetAlarmTime : set alarm time
SetAlarmTime --> TriggerAlarm : trigger alarm when current time matches set alarm time

@enduml
